{
  "_comment": [
    "The curated half of server-manifest.json. Humans decide what is in here;",
    "tools/manifest/generate-manifest.cjs measures everything else at ship time -",
    "payload file hashes from the staged tree, prerequisite zip hashes from",
    "fullinstall-base/prerequisites, install_order from the dependency graph, and",
    "the manifestVersion serial. Never write hashes or an install_order rule into",
    "this file: hand-edited hashes are wrong hashes, and the generator refuses a",
    "hand-written install_order outright (docs/MANIFEST-ARCHITECTURE.md, 9.1).",
    "",
    "Two modlist entries are EXCLUDED pending identification, per the doc (3.2):",
    "nexusModId 4198 (suspected duplicate ArchiveXL install over the pinned",
    "prerequisite - if confirmed, it gets removed, not named) and nexusModId 22114",
    "(name unconfirmed). Components get ids only once someone has read the Nexus",
    "page and confirmed what the thing actually is.",
    "",
    "Nexus components here are seeds awaiting their curation pass (doc 3.3, 5):",
    "the scanner install records version, fileId, archive sha256 and per-file",
    "hashes. Until then they carry only the identity fields a human can vouch for.",
    "'types': [\"resource\"] on a nexus entry marks a loading mechanism that has",
    "not been classified yet - the scanner replaces it with the real one.",
    "Authors marked 'see Nexus page' are likewise awaiting that same pass."
  ],

  "game": {
